1
00:00:09,976 --> 00:00:10,976
Huh?

2
00:00:11,845 --> 00:00:12,846
Why is it open?

3
00:00:22,622 --> 00:00:23,690
Is someone in here?

4
00:00:28,795 --> 00:00:29,896
No one's here, right?

5
00:00:34,134 --> 00:00:35,535
Boss, it's me.

6
00:00:36,302 --> 00:00:38,104
What are you doing here?

7
00:00:38,805 --> 00:00:41,107
I didn't know when you'll come
so I came here early.

8
00:00:42,442 --> 00:00:44,144
You're not supposed to
be here today.

9
00:00:44,477 --> 00:00:46,146
Didn't we get
a special order yesterday?

10
00:00:46,546 --> 00:00:47,546
What?

11
00:00:47,947 --> 00:00:48,947
Pardon?

12
00:00:49,015 --> 00:00:51,351
20 flower bouquets
by tomorrow morning?

13
00:00:51,684 --> 00:00:54,854
Normally, you need to
contact us two days before...

14
00:00:54,854 --> 00:00:56,222
You can't do that
all by yourself.

15
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,391
I'll help out.
